# Prompting Workflow

- Start with a short implementation plan before writing code.
- List the files that will be created or changed.
- Keep the scope narrow and do not refactor unrelated areas.
- Prefer compilable incremental edits.
- When adding a feature, implement protocols first, then services, then orchestrator logic, then UI wiring, then tests.
- If uncertain, choose the simplest working design.
- Preserve existing naming and structure unless explicitly asked to change them.